<title>AUSTRIA: Bank Austria board approves bid for CA.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria board approves bid for CA.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Austria's supervisory board has cleared the way for the management to submit a bid for Austria's second biggest bank, privatisation candidate Creditanstalt-Bankverein, Bank Austria said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
